[TITLE]
SIM-13: three positional control valves (PCVs), each between a reservoir and a junction
Each valve passes 1000 gpm through 12 in with a fully open loss coefficient of 10.
V1 is set beyond the last point of its curve; V2 has the same curve extended to (100,100).

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     1000
 J2   0     1000
 J3   0     1000

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   100
 R2   100
 R3   100

[VALVES]
;ID  N1  N2  Diam  Type  Setting  Mloss  Curve
 V1  R1  J1  12    PCV   90       10     C1    ; 90 % open, above C1's last point (80 %)
 V2  R2  J2  12    PCV   90       10     C2    ; same curve with an explicit (100,100)
 V3  R3  J3  12    PCV   50       10     C3    ; 50 % open, above C3's last point (1 %)

[CURVES]
;ID  % open  Kv/Kvo (%)
 C1  0       0
 C1  50      20
 C1  80      50
 C2  0       0
 C2  50      20
 C2  80      50
 C2  100     100
 C3  0       0
 C3  1       1

[TIMES]
 Duration  0

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM
 Headloss  H-W

[END]
